Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 22:30:45 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] HTDESIGNER-150: laptop package 111's designer part merged
 into the machine tree -- ES02's 0.149-0.150 (0.150.0)

GitHub main e8c4536 (GitLab bdc0f1ba), mixed; its C++ / web part = the integration session's cpp 0088 (c93a3bf).
Three-way on the package's base_e6d4da65 (= package 110), against the tree as it is now, CRLF to LF first: 12 files
changed only by ES02 and 2 new (media/htd_build.ps1, media/props_sample.json) copied byte for byte (BOMs as
delivered); CHANGELOG.md, HANDOVER.md on both sides (git merge-file, no conflict; the machine's notes kept).
lib/aliasedit.js and test/run_tests.js (the machine's tools 0136 Alias patch and test) not in the package: kept.
ES02's 0.149: the run bar's green play button = build and start wb_serve (check boxes Simulation / Debug pick the
build dir: build_nonoracle / build_dbg_nonoracle / build_integ_ship_x86 / build_integ_dbg_x86; a progress window
with Cancel; pause = break into the debugger); the side view frames blue-grey; the Properties panel with nothing
selected shows a TSpeedButton's properties / events greyed; the Solution Explorer highlights the matched letters.
0.150: with nothing selected, no explanation line, the name box empty.
WARNING on this machine: the green play button really builds and starts the machine software -- without
"Simulation" it is the shipping configuration; with it the 1203 card is still opened (pci1203.* can move axes).
Nothing here presses it; HANDOVER.md section 5 says so. media/htd_build.ps1 says "ASCII only" but has Chinese in its
first two comment lines -- harmless (comments), told to the laptop.
Tests: lib 177/177, probe 7/7 + tab tree 7/7, extension 214/214, panels all pass (the first run had one transient
fail -- the solution-wide search counted differently from the plain one while another session was writing files in
the tree; the re-run passes); e2e_build.ps1 not run.

